# The class escaping CANNOT repair: an IRI with no scheme. Resolving it needs a
# base IRI the .rete never recorded, so `--sanitize-iris` counts it, says so, and
# writes it verbatim — which means Oxigraph still rejects the dump. The test
# asserts exactly that, so the sanitizer can never be read as a promise it does
# not keep.
#
# 1 clean + 2 offending statements = 3 quads.
<http://example.org/ok> <http://example.org/p> "fine" .
<noscheme/path> <http://example.org/p> "no scheme at all" .
<http://example.org/ok> <http://example.org/rel> </absolute/path/but/still/relative> .
